SELECT define_provision($q$SBRC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2017@2024-10-28$q$, $q$QDC relationship: 1.6(4) and Table 1.6.1$q$, 'APPLICATION', $q$(4) The building assessment provisions in this planning scheme are identified in Table 1.6.1. || Table 1.6.1–Building Assessment Provisions | Building Assessment Provision | Planning Scheme Part || Bushfire prone areas || Designation of bushfire prone areas | In accordance with section 32(a) of the Building Act 1975 and section 7 of the Building Regulation 2021, this planning scheme designates the following layers of the Overlay Map OM2.1 to Overlay Map OM2.7 to constitute the bushfire prone area for the Building Code of Australia and Queensland Development Code: (a) Very high potential bushfire intensity; (b) High potential bushfire intensity; (c) Medium potential bushfire intensity; and (d) Potential impact buffer.$q$, 'VERIFIED_VERBATIM', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, $q$https://www.southburnett.qld.gov.au/files/assets/public/v/1/business/documents/planning-scheme/south_burnett_regional_council_planning_scheme_v20__1_.pdf$q$, NULL, NULL);
