SELECT define_rule($q${"rule_id": "SBRC.sbrc_rural_buildings_road", "instrument_version": "SBRC_PLANNING_SCHEME_2017@2024-10-28", "topic": "SETBACK.FRONTAGE", "title": "Table 6.2.13 AO1.1", "role": "REQUIREMENT", "regime": "PLANNING", "enforceability": "DEEMED_TO_COMPLY", "provision_kind": "ACCEPTABLE_OUTCOME", "measurement": "SCHEME_SETBACK_FRONT", "operator": ">=", "value": {"op": "unencoded", "text": "AO1.1 Buildings are set back 20m from any collector or higher order road and 10m from any other road frontage.", "extracted_value": null, "extracted_operator": "conditional"}, "unit": "m", "on_noncompliance": "PLANNING_APPROVAL_REQUIRED", "effective_from": "2024-10-28", "verification": "VERIFIED_VERBATIM", "automatable": false, "scopes": [{"level": "LOCAL_GOVERNMENT", "lg": "SOUTH_BURNETT"}, {"level": "ZONE", "zone": "SBRC:RURAL"}], "subjects": ["ANY"], "sources": [{"key": "sbrc_rural_buildings_road", "role": "PRIMARY"}], "interpretation_notes": "AUTO-IMPORTED (draft). Extracted structure: {\"parameter\": \"min_road_setback\", \"operator\": \"conditional\", \"value\": null, \"unit\": \"m\", \"conditions\": [\"collector or higher order road: 20 m\", \"any other road frontage: 10 m\"], \"exceptions\": [], \"formula_text\": null}\nStructure scope 'buildings' mapped by keyword to ['ANY'] (default)\nAlternative provision to QDC/QHC: NO - s1.6(4) says the building assessment provisions in the scheme are those in Table 1.6.1, which lists only the bushfire prone area designation; zone-code setbacks are not declared as QDC alternative provisions (s33 Building Act)\nResearcher notes: This applies to every road frontage, not only the primary frontage. Table 5.5.13: a dwelling house is accepted development (no requirements) if it does not involve a secondary dwelling and is not impact assessable. A dwelling house with a secondary dwelling is ADSR against \"Section 1, acceptable outcomes\", which includes AO1.1. The scheme does not define \"collector or higher order road\"; road hierarchy mapping is needed."}$q$::jsonb);
